        "original_id": "224e6ec7-6ddf-5289-b404-e657593c5cd6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yoo Seung-ho\n- Works: The Magician, Joseon Magician, Remember, Seondal: The Man Who Sells the River, Ruler: Master of the Mask\n- Topics: Mandatory military service, South Korean film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Yoo Seung-ho completed his two-year mandatory military service before taking these later leading roles.\n- In 2015, Yoo Seung-ho headlined the legal drama Remember.\n- In 2015, Yoo Seung-ho headlined the historical film The Magician.\n- The 2015 film The Magician is also known literally as Joseon Magician.\n- In 2016, Yoo Seung-ho headlined the historical film Seondal: The Man Who Sells the River.\n- In 2017, Yoo Seung-ho headlined the historical drama Ruler: Master of the Mask.",
